Package: giddh-dsc-bridge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Giddh <support@giddh.com>
Description: Giddh DSC Bridge native messaging host
 Connects the Giddh browser extension to hardware DSC (PKCS#11) tokens for
 client-side PDF signing. Installs a self-contained native-messaging host and
 registers it with Chromium-family browsers.
